      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing Vision AI**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google Cloud Vision AI for image label detection. I'll need to make sure the code specifically references this API provider. My goal is to create a functional `detect_image_labels.py` file using this service.\n\n\n**Defining Implementation Steps**\n\nI've sketched out the initial steps for `detect_image_labels.py`. The plan is to start with a blank file and add code for label detection using the Google Cloud Vision client, specifically focusing on provider identification within the imports and client setup. Next, I'll incorporate a placeholder for the image path. The goal is a functional script using this service.\n\n\n",
